  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2602.18 Permittee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2602.18 \"Permittee\" means the person to whom a permit to sell display and consumer or permissible fireworks has been issued.\n\nSource. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15 (from Saf-C 2602.15)",
